---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="contact-devis" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-[#f7f9ff] border-t border-[#e4eaf1] content-visibility-auto">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-14 border border-[#e4eaf1] shadow-xl grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Context & Hotline -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#edf4ff] text-[#00327d] text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider">
          <Icon name="bolt" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#0047ab]" />
          <span>Réponse sous 15 minutes</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-[#101d29] tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Demande d'Intervention ou Devis Gratuit
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm text-[#434653] leading-relaxed">
          Remplissez ce formulaire pour recevoir un devis clair et détaillé sans engagement, ou planifier le passage d'un technicien à Wavre et dans les communes avoisinantes.
        </p>

        <!-- Direct Emergency Box -->
        <div class="bg-[#123470] text-white rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3 shadow-md">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#fcd400] uppercase tracking-wider">
              Une urgence plomberie en cours ?
            </span>
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#059669] animate-pulse"></span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/80">
            En cas de fuite d'eau importante ou de WC totalement bouché, appelez immédiatement notre dépanneur d'astreinte :
          </p>
          <a
            href="tel:0465244571"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 w-full py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fcd400] text-[#101d29] font-display font-black text-lg hover:bg-[#e9c400] transition-colors tabular-nums shadow-sm"
          >
            <Icon name="phone" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#00327d]" />
            <span>0465 24 45 71</span>
          </a>
          <span class="block text-[11px] text-center text-white/70">
            Arrivée garantie sous 30 minutes sur l'entité de Wavre
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-[#434653] pt-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="shield" class="w-4 h-4 text-[#059669] shrink-0" />
            <span>Assurance AXA RC Pro & Décennale (Police 730.492.180)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-[#059669] shrink-0" />
            <span>Devis préalable gratuit et sans engagement</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <Icon name="award" class="w-4 h-4 text-[#0047ab] shrink-0" />
            <span>Certifié Cerga Gaz Wallonie H-39184</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: FormSubmit Form -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-[#f7f9ff] p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-[#e4eaf1]">
        <form
          action="https://formsubmit.co/midebzn@gmail.com"
          method="POST"
          class="space-y-4"
        >
          <!-- FormSubmit Configuration Fields -->
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Nouvelle Demande d'Intervention - Plombier Wavre Urgent" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
          <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://plombier-wavre-urgent.vercel.app/contact?succes=1" />

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <label for="form-name" class="text-xs font-bold text-[#101d29] uppercase tracking-wide">
                Nom & Prénom *
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                id="form-name"
                name="nom_prenom"
                required
                placeholder="Ex : Philippe Martin"
                class="w-full h-11 px-3.5 rounded-xl border border-[#d2dbe5] bg-white text-sm text-[#101d29] focus:border-[#0047ab] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#0047ab]/20 focus:outline-none transition-all"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1">
              <label for="form-phone" class="text-xs font-bold text-[#101d29] uppercase tracking-wide">
                Numéro de Téléphone *
              </label>
              <input
                type="tel"
                id="form-phone"
                name="telephone"
                required
                placeholder="Ex : 0470 12 34 56"
                class="w-full h-11 px-3.5 rounded-xl border border-[#d2dbe5] bg-white text-sm text-[#101d29] focus:border-[#0047ab] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#0047ab]/20 focus:outline-none transition-all"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <label for="form-email" class="text-xs font-bold text-[#101d29] uppercase tracking-wide">
                Adresse Email *
              </label>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="form-email"
                name="email"
                required
                placeholder="Ex : p.martin@exemple.be"
                class="w-full h-11 px-3.5 rounded-xl border border-[#d2dbe5] bg-white text-sm text-[#101d29] focus:border-[#0047ab] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#0047ab]/20 focus:outline-none transition-all"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1">
              <label for="form-commune" class="text-xs font-bold text-[#101d29] uppercase tracking-wide">
                Commune d'intervention *
              </label>
              <select
                id="form-commune"
                name="commune"
                required
                class="w-full h-11 px-3.5 rounded-xl border border-[#d2dbe5] bg-white text-sm text-[#101d29] focus:border-[#0047ab] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#0047ab]/20 focus:outline-none transition-all"
              >
                <option value="Wavre (1300)">Wavre Centre (1300)</option>
                <option value="Limal (1300)">Limal (1300)</option>
                <option value="Bierges (1301)">Bierges (1301)</option>
                <option value="Ottignies-LLN (1340/1348)">Ottignies - Louvain-la-Neuve</option>
                <option value="Rixensart-Genval (1330/1332)">Rixensart - Genval</option>
                <option value="Grez-Doiceau (1390)">Grez-Doiceau</option>
                <option value="Chaumont-Gistoux (1325)">Chaumont-Gistoux</option>
                <option value="Autre commune BW">Autre commune Brabant Wallon</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-1">
            <label for="form-service" class="text-xs font-bold text-[#101d29] uppercase tracking-wide">
              Type de prestation souhaitée *
            </label>
            <select
              id="form-service"
              name="prestation"
              required
              class="w-full h-11 px-3.5 rounded-xl border border-[#d2dbe5] bg-white text-sm text-[#101d29] focus:border-[#0047ab] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#0047ab]/20 focus:outline-none transition-all"
            >
              <option value="Depannage plomberie urgent">Dépannage plomberie d'urgence 24/7</option>
              <option value="Debouchage WC / canalisation">Débouchage WC, évier ou égout</option>
              <option value="Detection de fuite deau">Détection de fuite non destructive</option>
              <option value="Chauffage ou chaudiere">Chauffage, chaudière ou chauffe-eau</option>
              <option value="Traitement eau ou adoucisseur">Adoucisseur d'eau anti-calcaire</option>
              <option value="Installation sanitaire ou renovation">Installation sanitaire ou rénovation</option>
              <option value="Autre demande">Autre demande</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-1">
            <label for="form-message" class="text-xs font-bold text-[#101d29] uppercase tracking-wide">
              Description de votre besoin ou du problème
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="form-message"
              name="details_message"
              rows="3"
              placeholder="Précisez votre adresse exacte, l'état de la fuite ou le problème rencontré..."
              class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-[#d2dbe5] bg-white text-sm text-[#101d29] focus:border-[#0047ab] focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#0047ab]/20 focus:outline-none transition-all"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <button
            type="submit"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 py-3.5 px-6 rounded-xl bg-[#0047ab] hover:bg-[#00327d] text-white font-display font-extrabold text-sm shadow-md transition-all active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            <span>Envoyer ma demande d'intervention</span>
            <Icon name="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4" />
          </button>

          <p class="text-[11px] text-center text-[#434653]">
            Vos données personnelles sont strictement confidentielles et traitées dans le respect du RGPD pour l'établissement de votre devis.
          </p>
        </form>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
